# 可在 VS Code (REST Client) / Rider / Visual Studio 直接執行的範例請求。
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@apiKey = dev-api-key-change-me-1234

### 列出監控項目
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 建立：柏林每日 02:30 備份
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Offsite backup (Berlin)",
  "slug": "berlin-backup",
  "scheduleType": "Cron",
  "cronExpression": "30 2 * * *",
  "graceMinutes": 45,
  "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
}

### 建立：非法輸入 → 400（三個欄位的錯誤會一起回報）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Broken",
  "slug": "broken",
  "scheduleType": "Cron",
  "cronExpression": "61 25 * * *",
  "graceMinutes": -1,
  "timeZone": "Mars/Olympus"
}

### 更新
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors/1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Offsite backup (Berlin)",
  "slug": "berlin-backup",
  "scheduleType": "Cron",
  "cronExpression": "30 2 * * *",
  "graceMinutes": 60,
  "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
}

### 暫停 / 恢復
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors/1/pause
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors/1/resume
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 事件歷史（分頁）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors/1/events?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 通知與派送嘗試紀錄
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors/1/notifications
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 近 30 天可用率
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/monitors/1/availability?days=30
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Ping（把 TOKEN 換成建立時回傳的 pingToken）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ping/TOKEN/start

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/ping/TOKEN

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/ping/TOKEN/fail

### 自我健康檢查
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
